From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sensorfw: expose raw SpO2 reading contract

Carry the LifeQ SpO2 value, confidence, algorithm, and signal fields without
misclassifying algorithm states as legacy accuracy. Expose the raw sample as
D-Bus structure (tdddd), while preserving the established (iii) property and
legacy socket record size. Intermediate readings cannot report legacy high
confidence.

The raw fields are internal Spo2Data pipeline state. Spo2LegacyData is the
explicit record sent to existing socket consumers; new consumers should use
the spo2Reading D-Bus property for raw values and timestamp updates.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Hoki-specific extension]

---
